<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-West Indies 213 for eight v Australia.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-West Indies 213 for eight v Australia.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies lost another wicket to be 213 for eight with one over remaining in their limited overs match against Australia A at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Friday.</p>
<p>Tail-ender Ian Bishop was bowled for nine after swinging wildly at a delivery by Ian Harvey.</p>
<p>Jimmy Adams was 23 not out and the new batsman was Nixon McLean.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
